{"comment_text": {"ja64:0.1": "", "ja64:0.2": "", "ja64:0.3": "", "ja64:0.4": "", "ja64:1.1": "When a wife has been good, she expects her husband to be nice to her; but when she has been bad, she is nice to him. The complexity of these behaviors is evidently too much for her husband, who seeks counsel for his confusion. Rather than make an effort to understand his wife, he is advised to simply ignore her feelings. ", "ja64:1.2": "", "ja64:1.3": "<i lang='pi' translate='no'>Thīnaṁ</i> is genitive plural, glossed <i lang='pi' translate='no'>itthīnaṁ</i>. | The Dhamma is also “hard to understand” (<a href='https://suttacentral.net/snp3.12/en/sujato#59.1'>Snp 3.12:59.1</a>). ", "ja64:1.4": "", "ja64:2.1": ""}, "html_text": {"ja64:0.1": "<article id='ja64'><header><ul><li class='division'>{}</li>", "ja64:0.2": "<li>{}</li>", "ja64:0.3": "<li>{}</li></ul>", "ja64:0.4": "<h1 class='sutta-title'>{}</h1></header>", "ja64:1.1": "<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja64:1.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja64:1.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja64:1.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja64:2.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja64:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja64:0.2": "Ekakanipāta ", "ja64:0.3": "Itthivagga ", "ja64:0.4": "4. Durājānajātaka ", "ja64:1.1": "Mā su nandi icchati maṁ, ", "ja64:1.2": "mā su soci na micchati; ", "ja64:1.3": "Thīnaṁ bhāvo durājāno, ", "ja64:1.4": "macchassevodake gatan”ti. ", "ja64:2.1": "Durājānajātakaṁ catutthaṁ. "}, "translation_text": {"ja64:0.1": "Stories of Past Lives 64 ", "ja64:0.2": "The Book of the Ones ", "ja64:0.3": "Women ", "ja64:0.4": "Hard to Understand: a past life story ", "ja64:1.1": "Do not rejoice, “She loves me,” ", "ja64:1.2": "nor lament, “She loves me not.” ", "ja64:1.3": "The mood of women is hard to understand, ", "ja64:1.4": "like the track of fish in water. ", "ja64:2.1": ""}, "variant_text": {"ja64:0.1": "", "ja64:0.2": "", "ja64:0.3": "", "ja64:0.4": "", "ja64:1.1": "", "ja64:1.2": "na micchati → na icchati (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja64:1.3": "", "ja64:1.4": "", "ja64:2.1": ""}, "reference_text": {"ja64:0.1": "", "ja64:0.2": "", "ja64:0.3": "", "ja64:0.4": "", "ja64:1.1": "dr27.22, ms22J_141, msdiv64, pts-vp-pli1.300, sya27.21", "ja64:1.2": "", "ja64:1.3": "", "ja64:1.4": "", "ja64:2.1": "ms22J_142"}, "keys_order": ["ja64:0.1", "ja64:0.2", "ja64:0.3", "ja64:0.4", "ja64:1.1", "ja64:1.2", "ja64:1.3", "ja64:1.4", "ja64:2.1"]}